@page "/"

<PageTitle>LoanFlow</PageTitle>

<h1>LoanFlow</h1>

<p>
    A small loan-application pipeline for learning Blazor, dependency injection,
    Azure Service Bus and RabbitMQ, with MongoDB for applications and SQL Server
    (through EF Core) for the loans that get paid out.
</p>

<ol>
    <li>Open <NavLink href="status">Infrastructure status</NavLink>. MongoDB, Service Bus and RabbitMQ should be green; SQL Server stays yellow until step 4.</li>
    <li>Follow the build plan in <code>README.md</code>. Every place you need to write code is marked <code>TODO(step N)</code>.</li>
</ol>

<p class="text-muted small">
    Find them with <code>git grep -n "TODO(step 1)"</code>, or your IDE's TODO window.
</p>
